        "explanation": "Adapts to patient fear/refusal with a practical strategy that preserves patient participation.",
        "quote": "不要等他说\"好，我去\"再约门诊。先约，再邀请。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "excellent",
