          "quote": "先约，再邀请"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00243",
          "explanation": "When the family was already at the hospital with unresolved admission/anesthesia status, it shifted to immediate on-site clarification questions.",
          "quote": "今天是办住院，还是只做麻醉会诊和补检查？"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "New events repeatedly changed the plan: patient resistance led to structured clinician-led discussion, and hospital-arrival uncertainty led to a focused on-site checklist about admission, anesthesia, fasting, medications, and timing.",
