          "quote": "要带的（按顺序）："
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00222",
          "explanation": "Separates the hospital-confirmation tasks into a concise ordered question set.",
          "quote": "到了医院重点问 5 个问题"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00263",
          "explanation": "Final closure separates home actions and emergency triggers while naming unresolved scheduling/anesthesia issues.",
          "quote": "这几天，**默认状态就是\"没消息就是正常\""
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The model produced action-card style guidance across the episode, separating what to bring, what to ask/confirm before surgery and anesthesia, what to do at home, what not to self-execute, and when to go to emergency care, while leaving date/pathology decisions to the treating team.",
